  "content": {
    "id": "p52-q12-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "$f(x)=\\sin x+\\cos(90^{\\circ}-x)$. Decide whether $f(x)$ is odd, even, or neither.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Odd.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=\\sin x+\\sin x\\\\f(x)&=2\\sin x\\\\f(-x)&=2\\sin(-x)\\\\f(-x)&=-2\\sin x\\\\f(-x)&=-f(x)\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $f$ is odd.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
